ArisuWeapon: {
	DisplayName: Light Sword: Supernova
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Fire with left click. Every five shots fill one energy level. Full energy boosts normal shots to 135% damage.
		At full energy, hold right click for two seconds to fire a rail round through terrain. Releasing early cancels the charge.
		Automatically drinks mana potions from your inventory when mana is insufficient.
		'''
	FlavorTooltip: The Engineering Club entrusted this enormous railgun to Aris.
	Growth: Base damage from boss progression: {0}
	Energy: Energy: {0}/2
}

